  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A thermodynamic system is taken from an original state <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> to an intermediate state <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> by a linear process as shown in the figure. Its volume is then reduced to the original value from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> by an isobaric process. The total work done by the gas from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> would be :</p><img src=\"assets\\qt0040_2f2c4f2d065b.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 222px;\"/>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>33800</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2200</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>600</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>800</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0040_2f2c4f2d065b.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 222px;\"/></p><p>Work done during the path <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> can be written as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>8000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4000</mn><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mi>dyne</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mi>dyne</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2400</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The work done during the process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>BC</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mn>4000</mn><mo> </mo><mi>dyne</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mi>dyne</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1600</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Hence, the total work done is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>W</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>BC</mi></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2400</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1600</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>800</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>"
  }
